    <skos:altLabel>Community Legal Centre</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Legal Clinic</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Legal Clinic is an organization that provides free or low-cost legal services to individuals and communities, often staffed by law students under the supervision of licensed attorneys. It offers practical legal education to students while serving the legal needs of underserved populations.</skos:definition>
