    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cuenta establecida</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Compte établi</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Account Stated</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">חשבון מצוין</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">口座明細提示</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Conta estabelecida</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>An account stated is a legal claim that arises when two parties have agreed on the amount of a debt owed and the debtor has promised to pay it. It falls under the category of contract and quasi-contract claims.</skos:definition>
