    <rdfs:label>Secured Creditor</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A secured creditor is any creditor or lender associated with an investment in or issuance of a credit product backed by collateral. Secured creditors have a first-order claim on the payouts of a distressed credit investment.</skos:definition>
