    <skos:definition>A Consumer Loan Broker Acting Improperly refers to a situation where a broker who arranges loans for consumers engages in unethical or illegal behavior, such as misrepresenting loan terms or charging excessive fees.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Consumer Loan Broker Acting Improperly</rdfs:label>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Corredor de préstamos al consumidor actuando de manera inapropiada</skos:altLabel>
