  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/oSmDmJrQR8i-AuHApZq3pQ">
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) salting, roasting, drying, cooking, or canning nuts; (2) processing grains or seeds into snacks; (3) manufacturing peanut butter; and (4) manufacturing potato chips, corn chips, popped popcorn, pretzels (except soft), pork rinds, and similar snacks.</skos:definition>
