    <rdfs:label>Secrecy</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Secrecy refers to the legal defense strategy of withholding information or evidence from the opposing party in a legal matter, typically to protect confidential or privileged information.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
