    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">危险的家养动物</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Dangerous Domesticated Animals: Domesticated animals that have a propensity to cause harm or injury to humans or other animals, and are subject to specific legal regulations and liabilities.</skos:definition>
