    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>E122 Local counsel</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>E122 Local counsel refers to the expenses incurred for hiring an attorney who is licensed to practice law in a specific jurisdiction and who provides legal representation and advice to a client in that jurisdiction.</skos:definition>
