    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Internet, Data Processing and Hosting Industry</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie de l'Internet, du traitement des données et de l'hébergement</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Internet, Data Processing and Hosting</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">互联网、数据处理和托管行业</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de Internet, Procesamiento de Datos y Alojamiento</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RHwCmZ2yKrJobzC86GC6Ep"/>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>INTE</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <dc:identifier>INF-INTE</dc:identifier>
    <skos:definition>Industries in the Web Search Portals, Libraries, Archives, and Other Information Services subsector group establishments supplying information, storing and providing access to information, searching and retrieving information, and operating Web sites that use search engines to allow for searching information on the Internet. The main components of the subsector are libraries, archives, and Web search portals.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Industries in the Web Search Portals, Libraries, Archives, and Other Information Services subsector group establishments supplying information, storing and providing access to information, searching and retrieving information, and operating Web sites that use search engines to allow for searching information on the Internet.  The main components of the subsector are libraries, archives, and Web search portals.
</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Computing Infrastructure Providers, Data Processing, Web Hosting, and Related Services</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>Web Search Portals, Libraries, Archives, and Other Information Industry</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:legacyIdentifier>http://code.sali.org/v1/LMSS/#Ind-INF-INTE</ns2:legacyIdentifier>
