    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=31499"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing nonapparel textile products (except carpet, rugs, curtains, linens, bags, and canvas products) from purchased materials.  This industry includes establishments primarily engaged in decorative stitching such as embroidery or other art needlework on textile products, including apparel.</skos:definition>
