    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Loss of Consortium refers to the damages suffered by a spouse or parent due to the injury or death of their loved one, which includes the loss of companionship, affection, and support.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
