    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <ns1:contractFamily xml:lang="en">Insurance &amp; Risk Transfer</ns1:contractFamily>
    <skos:prefLabel>General Liability Insurance</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>General Business Liability Insurance, also known simply as general liability insurance, provides coverage for common business risks, including bodily injury and property damage that occur at the business premises or as a result of business operations. It also often covers legal costs related to these risks. This type of insurance is foundational for most businesses.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
