    <skos:definition>An L420 Expert Witness is a professional who possesses specialized knowledge or skills in a particular field and is called upon to provide testimony in a legal proceeding related to that field.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>L420 Expert Witnesses</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
