  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB9lBiVnIqvFRic73I8ZWwo">
    <skos:definition>Legislative Research Management is the process of organizing and managing legal research specifically related to legislative materials, such as bills, statutes, and regulations.</skos:definition>
