    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>An Improper Lane Change Claim involves an allegation that a driver has changed lanes in a manner that violates traffic regulations, potentially endangering other road users. This claim can lead to civil penalties or administrative actions and often requires detailed examination of the circumstances and evidence surrounding the incident.</skos:definition>
