    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula de garantía estándar</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Standard Warranty Clause</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A standard warranty clause is a specific type of warranty clause that outlines the terms and conditions of a warranty agreement in a standardized manner.</skos:definition>
