    <rdfs:label>Amendment Agreement</rdfs:label>
    <ns1:contractFamily xml:lang="en">General Commercial</ns1:contractFamily>
    <skos:prefLabel>Variation Agreement</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>An Amendment Agreement is a legal document that modifies, adds to, or deletes specific terms and conditions of an existing contract. It must be agreed upon and signed by the same parties who executed the original agreement, ensuring that the changes are legally binding.</skos:definition>
