  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBPsxBT931DDyTjxIBVJgE0">
    <skos:notation>folio:isMemberOf</skos:notation>
    <skos:notation>folio:isPartOf</skos:notation>
    <rdfs:label>isMemberOf</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>sali:isMemberOf</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <skos:altLabel>is a part of</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>is a member of</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:example>Partner is Member of Partnership</skos:example>
    <skos:example>Juror is Member of Jury</skos:example>
    <skos:example>Director is Member of Board of Directors</skos:example>
    <skos:example>Creditor is Member of Creditor's Committee</skos:example>
    <skos:definition>In legal and organizational contexts, "is member of" signifies the belonging or inclusion of an individual or entity in a specific group, committee, board, or organization. This denotes that the individual or entity has a role, responsibilities, rights, or a position within the collective body, subject to its rules, objectives, and governance structure.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>isPartOf</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBCaxiBwyfzT4iSxezQE1Fb">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de cessão de créditos</skos:altLabel>
