  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RC0g77dd9wMb7dDuVw3zC3">
    <skos:definition>The concept of "Escrow Agent's Negligence and Constructive Fraud" refers to legal claims against real estate agents and brokers for their failure to exercise reasonable care in handling funds and documents held in escrow, resulting in harm to the parties involved.</skos:definition>
