    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="Nfa4bf6f61c7d43cbb3d16ffeb629f325"/>
    <skos:definition>A witness or non-party is a person or entity called upon to produce documents or provide testimony or other information in connection with a dispute or proceeding (and not a party to the dispute or proceeding).</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">गवाह</skos:altLabel>
