    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause Intuitu Personae</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Intuitu Personae Clause</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>An Intuitu Personae Clause is a contractual clause that requires the performance of a specific obligation by a particular person, based on their personal characteristics or qualifications, rather than allowing for a substitute to perform the obligation.</skos:definition>
