  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/DGNYyo0YT7OIzI5PfpTInQ">
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises legal entities known as bank holding companies primarily engaged in holding the securities of (or other equity interests in) companies and enterprises for the purpose of owning a controlling interest or influencing the management decisions of these firms. The holding companies in this industry do not administer, oversee, and manage other establishments of the company or enterprise whose securities they hold.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/KpnX0l0NSye8rqjt4kKV7A"/>
