    <skos:hiddenLabel>ARB</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <skos:definition>Arbitration, a form of alternative dispute resolution (ADR), is a way to resolve disputes outside the courts. The dispute will be decided by one or more persons (the "arbitrators", "arbiters" or "arbitral tribunal"), which renders the "arbitration award".</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
