    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">חוק הקנאביס</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Cannabis Law refers to the legal rules and regulations governing the use, possession, sale, cultivation, and distribution of cannabis, both for medical and recreational purposes. These laws vary significantly between jurisdictions, ranging from total prohibition to decriminalization or full legalization, and they may involve aspects of criminal, business, and health law among others</skos:definition>
    <dc:identifier>IN-LAW-5</dc:identifier>
    <rdfs:label>Cannabis Law</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel>Cannabis Law</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:source>Integrated from add/ ontology files on 2026-07-07; add/Law.json</dc:source>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
