    <dc:identifier>IN-INDUSTRY-20</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>WHT</dc:identifier>
    <skos:definition>The Wholesale Trade industry group comprises establishments engaged in wholesaling merchandise, generally without transformation, and rendering services incidental to the sale of merchandise. The merchandise described in this sector includes the outputs of agriculture, mining, manufacturing, and certain information industries, such as publishing. The wholesaling process is an intermediate step in the distribution of merchandise.</skos:definition>
