  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDZzr8ea6OmlnWKGtslDv9C">
    <skos:definition>Chapter 9 bankruptcy is a bankruptcy for municipalities ' cities, towns, counties and school districts, for example. Municipalities that file chapter 9 earn protection from creditors while they develop a plan for adjusting their debts.</skos:definition>
