    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>JE00 Issue / Statements of Case (UK J-CODE)</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Covers issue and acknowledgment of proceedings, Statements of Case and Further Information requests/responses.  Includes taking instructions, making inquiries and searches, researching, drafting, editing, filing and all meetings and communications for the purpose of such documents.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
