  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDIG3RqMsXhfzulZ3cVzK94">
    <skos:altLabel>Permit Review</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Development Approval Process</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Property Development Authorization Review</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Building Permit Evaluation</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Real Estate Permit Review consists of legal services related to relevant regulatory authorities' formal evaluation process to assess and approve or deny permit applications related to real estate development or modification. The review ensures that the proposed activities comply with existing land use regulations, building codes, and other applicable laws and policies.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Construction Permit Review</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Real Estate Permit Review</rdfs:label>
