    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Limited Conservatorship of Adult</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Limited Conservatorship of Adult is a legal arrangement in which a conservator is appointed to manage the personal and/or financial affairs of an adult with developmental disabilities who is unable to fully care for themselves, but only to the extent necessary to provide for their basic needs and protect them from harm.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
