    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de zona de amortecimento paisagístico</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Landscape Buffer Clause is a provision in a contract that requires the preservation of a natural area between two properties to provide a visual or physical barrier.</skos:definition>
