  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RGEgmKbY18qXXUvDzNAmv3">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">“优越报价”或“合理预计将导致优越报价的收购提议”语言</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Überlegenes Angebot oder Akquisitionsangebot, bei dem vernünftigerweise zu erwarten ist, dass es zu einem überlegenen Angebot führt</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">उत्कृष्ट प्रस्ताव, या उत्कृष्ट प्रस्ताव के नतीजे में अनुमानित रूप से होने वाले अधिग्रहण प्रस्ताव भाषा</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Oferta superior, o propuesta de adquisición razonablemente probable/esperada de resultar en una Oferta Superior</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הצעת רכישה עליונה, או הצעת רכישה הצפויה בהסתייגות עליונה</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">「優れた提案、または妥当な理由があって優れた提案が期待される買収提案」の言語</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Offre supérieure ou proposition d'acquisition raisonnablement susceptible de donner lieu à une offre supérieure</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Oferta superior, o propuesta de adquisición razonablemente probable/esperada de resultar en una Oferta Superior</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Superior Offer, or Acquisition Proposal reasonably likely/expected to result in a Superior Offer Language</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Oferta superior ou proposta de aquisição razoavelmente provável de resultar em uma oferta superior</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A "Superior Offer, or Acquisition Proposal reasonably likely/expected to result in a Superior Offer" is a proposal made during a legal matter that is expected to be better than any other offers made, and triggers an exception to a previously agreed upon no-shop covenant.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R82ikX2gSG3Kyc0OXqOpZve"/>
    <rdfs:label>"Superior Offer, or Acquisition Proposal reasonably likely/expected to result in a Superior Offer" Language</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
