  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RxNwDQ5PLYnwvIGnKx1FwR">
    <skos:altLabel>Corporate Campaigns Service</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Strategic Corporate Influence</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Corporate Campaigns</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Corporate Advocacy Practice</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Corporate Campaigns Practice involves the development and execution of strategy and strategic communication efforts aimed at influencing corporate policies and practices. This practice includes managing campaigns that address issues such as employee rights, environmental sustainability, and corporate social responsibility to achieve specific advocacy goals.</skos:definition>
