    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=516210"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily providing media streaming distribution services, operating social network sites, operating media broadcasting and cable television networks, and supplying information, such as news reports, articles, pictures, and features, to the news media. These establishments distribute textual, audio, and/or video content of general or specific interest.</skos:definition>
