    <skos:definition>Industries in the General Merchandise Retailers subsector retail new general merchandise.  This subsector includes new and used general merchandise auction retailers and establishments generally known as department stores, warehouse clubs, superstores, or supercenters.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCMo6x3xKnF8SK0kIugFqSp">
