    <skos:definition>The concept of Evading Arrest refers to the act of intentionally avoiding or running away from a law enforcement officer who is attempting to make an arrest, and is classified as a type of criminal misdemeanor offense.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
