    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Faute professionnelle en dermatologie</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Negligence or breach of duty by a medical professional in the field of dermatology, resulting in harm or injury to a patient.</skos:definition>
