    <skos:hiddenLabel>LICE</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <dc:identifier>LICE</dc:identifier>
    <skos:definition>A licensee is a person or entity to whom a license is granted. A licensee has the license to use someone else's specified property such as a building, a land or intellectual property.</skos:definition>
