    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Groundwater Rights</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Groundwater rights concern the use of water that exists beneath the surface of the land, often in underground reservoirs or aquifers. Regulations and allocations vary by region and can depend on factors like recharge rates and overall availability.</skos:definition>
