    <skos:definition>Industries in the Health and Personal Care Retailers subsector retail health and personal care merchandise.  Establishments in this subsector are characterized principally by the products they retail, and some health and personal care retailers have specialized staff including pharmacists, opticians, and other professionals engaged in retailing, advising customers, and/or fitting the product sold to the customer's needs.</skos:definition>
