    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in compiling information, such as credit and employment histories, and providing the information to financial institutions, retailers, and others who have a need to evaluate the creditworthiness of individuals and businesses.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Credit agencies</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Credit rating services</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Illustrative Examples:</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Credit reporting bureaus</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>Credit investigation services</skos:definition>
