    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Force Majeure &amp; Change in Law</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Risks in the relief available for events outside the parties' control, covering the breadth of the force majeure definition, the burden of notice and evidence, relief limited to time only, and the allocation and cut-off date for changes in law.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
