    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>Reorganization Agreement is a contract detailing the terms and conditions of a corporate reorganization, including mergers, acquisitions, or other structural changes. This agreement outlines the rights of stakeholders and procedures for the reorganization.</skos:definition>
