    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Fraud Permitting Reformation or Rescission</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Fraude permitiendo la reforma o rescisión</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Fraud Permitting Reformation or Rescission: A legal claim that allows for the modification or cancellation of a contract due to fraudulent behavior by one of the parties involved.</skos:definition>
