    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">環境法的請求</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תביעות דיני סביבה</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Environmental Law Claims refer to legal actions brought under civil, statutory, and regulatory frameworks to address harm caused by pollution or other environmental damage, including claims related to nuisance, resource conservation and recovery, clean water, groundwater contamination, oil spills, clean air, and soil contamination.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>Pollution Claim</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Environmental Law Claims</rdfs:label>
