    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de legenda restritiva</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A restrictive legend clause is a provision in a contract that limits the transferability of securities by requiring the purchaser to hold the securities for a certain period of time or to obtain the issuer's consent before selling them.</skos:definition>
