    <rdfs:label>Respondeat Superior</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Respondeat Superior is a legal concept that holds an employer or principal liable for the wrongful acts or omissions committed by their employees or agents in the course of their employment or agency.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
