    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N92bbfc0ce8af46f7bae1a4cab22f748d"/>
    <skos:definition>The Lessor's Breach of Express Warranty on Goods refers to the failure of the party leasing goods to fulfill a specific promise or guarantee made about the quality or condition of the goods, resulting in legal claims by the lessee.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Lessor’s Breach of Express Warranty on Goods</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
