    <rdfs:label>Antitrust - Predatory Pricing Claims</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Antitrust - Predatory Pricing Claims refer to allegations of anti-competitive behavior by a company that sets prices below cost with the intention of driving competitors out of the market.</skos:definition>
