    <rdfs:label>Pesticide and Other Agricultural Chemical Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the formulation and preparation of agricultural and household pest control chemicals (except fertilizers).</skos:definition>
