    <rdfs:label>tax_tiers</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>"""tax_tiers"" = Y only where there are different tax rates applicable to billed tiers.   

If Tiered Tax = ""Y"", the LEDES invoice should contain only one matter; multiple matters/invoice are not allowed for Tiered Taxes.
"</skos:definition>
