  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/KRuvvbv4SSGsD-kU7TEA4Q">
    <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in retailing new, used, and/or rebuilt automotive parts and accessories, including tires and tubes. Included in this industry group are establishments primarily engaged in retailing automotive parts and accessories in combination with automotive repair services.</skos:definition>
