  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/UUbVZ4-4RN2ytfsuyfT1fQ">
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in operating motion picture theaters (except drive-ins) and/or exhibiting motion pictures or videos at film festivals, and so forth.</skos:definition>
