    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=62139"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments of independent health practitioners (except physicians; dentists; chiropractors; optometrists; mental health specialists; physical, occupational, and speech therapists; and audiologists).  These practitioners operate private or group practices in their own offices (e.g., centers, clinics) or in the facilities of others, such as hospitals or HMO medical centers.</skos:definition>
