    <skos:altLabel>Federal Prosecutor's Office</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Governmental Criminal Law Division</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Governmental Criminal Law Division is a government entity responsible for prosecuting criminal cases on behalf of the public. It conducts investigations, files charges, represents the government in criminal trials, and ensures the enforcement of criminal laws.</skos:definition>
