  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7ZXlNb1fYV5MAmgwbumc2m">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>payable_by_cl_name</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RHfeijrOTjaF7qpuoGIGkR"/>
    <skos:definition>"The name of the party paying the invoice.  May not be the same party that is paying VAT on the invoice.  

The legal name of the party paying the invoice may also be different from the CLIENT.cl_name, the INVOICE tax_invoice_cl_name and the INVOICE.bill_to_cl_name.  In some jurisdictions it may be required by law to provide this information.
"</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
