    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Práctica de financiamiento de capital</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Equity financing is the method of raising capital by selling company stock to investors. In return for the investment, the shareholders receive ownership interests in the company.</skos:definition>
