    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">वेक्सेटियस लिटिगेंट</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A party who has abused the court system by filing too many frivolous lawsuits may be prohibited from filing another suit or matter.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>A plaintiff who has abused the court system by filing too many frivolous lawsuits may be prohibited from filing another suit.</skos:definition>
