    <rdfs:label>Excessive Bail Claim</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>An excessive bail claim is a legal action initiated by an individual alleging that their Eighth Amendment right to be free from excessive bail has been violated by the government or a government actor. The Eighth Amendment prohibits the government from imposing excessive bail, which is a monetary sum set by a court to ensure that an individual shows up for trial or other legal proceedings. An excessive bail claim may arise in various contexts, such as when a court sets an unreasonably high bail amount that is beyond the individual's ability to pay, or when a court sets bail at a level that is disproportionate to the offense committed.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8NvVLe26lWZXxjXVtX1uuU">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Falsche Verhaftung und Freiheitsberaubung</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>False Imprisonment</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Arrestation et emprisonnement injustifiés</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">错误逮捕和监禁</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Prisão e detenção ilegais</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">עצירה ומעצר שוים</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Detención y encarcelamiento ilegal</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">不当逮捕および拘禁</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">गलत गिरफ्तार और कैद</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Detención y encarcelamiento ilegal</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">False Arrest and Imprisonment</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>False Arrest</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8alUnZrt8GVEzHYhh1KTva"/>
    <skos:definition>The concept of False Arrest and Imprisonment refers to the unlawful detention or confinement of an individual without legal justification or consent, resulting in a violation of their personal liberty and freedom of movement.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>False Arrest and Imprisonment</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/MyYW-tXUQDSLGibJTLAGAQ">
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing truck and bus bodies and cabs and automobile bodies. The products made may be sold separately or may be assembled on purchased chassis and sold as complete vehicles.</skos:definition>
