    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Site &amp; Design Risk</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Risk arising from the physical and geotechnical conditions of the site, and from whether the design prepared for that site is adequate.</skos:definition>
