    <rdfs:label>Anti-Bribery Clause</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>An Anti-Bribery Clause is a provision in a contract that prohibits the offering, giving, receiving, or soliciting of any form of bribe or kickback in connection with the performance of the contract.</skos:definition>
