    <rdfs:label>Malpractice Claims</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Malpractice Claims refer to civil claims of negligence or malfeasance brought against a professional or tradesperson, such as a doctor, lawyer, accountant, or architect, for failing to meet the standard of care expected in their field.</skos:definition>
