    <skos:definition>Negligent or improper actions or omissions by an obstetrician gynecologist (OB GYN) that result in harm or injury to a patient, leading to a legal claim for damages.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Rw514WrvQbSAQN7bZyT3fK">
