    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Jurisdicción de la materia</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Subject-Matter Jurisdiction refers to the authority of a court to hear and decide a particular type of legal dispute, based on the subject matter of the case and the laws governing it.</skos:definition>
