    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Arrendador insolvente que ha arrendado bienes</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Bailleur insolvable ayant loué des biens</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>An Insolvent Lessor Having Leased Goods refers to a legal claim arising from a contract or quasi-contract where the lessor of goods is unable to pay their debts and has leased the goods to another party.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Insolvent Lessor Having Leased Goods</rdfs:label>
