  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9HLUMVIgthompejqWqUHOe">
    <skos:definition>Pathology Malpractice refers to a type of medical malpractice claim that arises from errors or negligence in the examination and diagnosis of tissue samples and bodily fluids by pathologists.</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">पैथोलॉजी लापरवाही</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">病理医疗事故</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Negligência médica em patologia</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Pathology Malpractice</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Negligencia médica en patología</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Faute professionnelle en pathologie</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Pathologiefehler</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Negligencia médica en patología</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">病理学的医療過誤</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">שגיאה רפואית בפתולוגיה</skos:altLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Pathology Malpractice</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8nVhrBlasGIc7jxw1D0vbm"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDFRFxY94fI8g3YrioLXDTZ">
    <skos:altLabel>Marxist-Leninist Law</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>State Law</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Socialist Legal Framework</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Socialist Law System</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel>Communist Law</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>Socialist Law is a legal system that developed in communist states, primarily based on the principles of Marxism-Leninism. This system emphasizes state ownership of property, centralized planning, and the role of the state in enforcing laws that promote socialist values.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RVPwUkNgWhlwyYWWSPrLuZ"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RlPUVFgTvSbSVS64OwQ5C8A">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RqWEj2n_aQXyfLT5Z4KzCow"/>
    <skos:prefLabel>TR240 Opposition Investigation</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label>TR240 Opposition Investigation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>All actions associated with investigating a claim or potential claim of trademark opposition, trademark infringement or trademark dilution before a trademark office tribunal, including definition of the scope of the investigation, searching, analyzing the search results, and reporting the search results to the client. Work of outside vendors in conducting searches or otherwise assisting the investigation should be an expense under E100. This code set is for determining the facts and recommendations of an opposition matter. Any formal opinion should be prepared under TR710. Any subsequent work completed in a contested matter would be completed under TR440 or TR640 respectively.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
