  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/_KWwrDokSeCRlIlOGOkBpA">
    <rdfs:label>Sales Financing Industry</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in sales financing or sales financing in combination with leasing. Sales financing establishments are primarily engaged in lending money for the purpose of providing collateralized goods through a contractual installment sales agreement, either directly from or through arrangements with dealers.</skos:definition>
