    <rdfs:label>Closed During Tail Period</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>The concept of "Closed During Tail Period" refers to a specific timing of the acquisition proposal closing, where the target company is not allowed to consider any other offers during a certain period after the initial offer has been made.</skos:definition>
