  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R87ItBEU3GWsIfCKGG3RMPN">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Définition de l'effet indésirable important - Langage "Découlant de et résultant de"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Definição de Efeito Adverso Material - Linguagem "Decorrente de e Resultante De"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Material Adverse Effect Definition - "Arising from/out of and Resulting From" Language</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">重大な不利な影響の定義-「起因し/由来し、かつ、それによって生じる」言語</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">सामग्री विपरीत प्रभाव परिभाषा - "Arising from/out of and Resulting From" भाषा</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגדרת השפעה נזיקה חומרית - שפת "Arising from/out of and Resulting From"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">重大不利影响定义-“源自/来自和由此产生的”语言</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>MAE</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Definition des wesentlichen nachteiligen Effekts - Sprache "Entstehend aus/ausgehend von und resultierend aus"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje "Arising from/out of and Resulting From"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje "Arising from/out of and Resulting From"</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RgBq3kUkMfNYtUi93XIh0i"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>A Material Adverse Effect (MAE) Definition - "Arising from/out of and Resulting From" Language refers to a clause in a contract that outlines the specific circumstances under which a party can terminate the agreement due to a significant negative change in the financial condition or business operations of the other party, which must be directly caused by a specific event or circumstance.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Material Adverse Effect Definition - "Arising from/out of and Resulting From" Language</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
