    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://idm-tmng.uspto.gov/id-master-list-public.html"/>
    <skos:definition>When filing for trademark registration, the classes of goods or services that the trademark covers (e.g., clothing, electronics, musical groups), as defined by the regulatory agency (e.g., U.S. Patent &amp; Trademark Office).</skos:definition>
