    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de cessão de interesse de segurança</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>An Assignment of Security Interest Clause is a provision in a legal agreement that allows a creditor to transfer their security interest in a property to another party.</skos:definition>
