    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>An Insolvent Buyer Having Bought Goods refers to a legal claim arising from a situation where a buyer who is unable to pay for goods purchased becomes insolvent, and the seller seeks to recover the value of the goods sold.</skos:definition>
