    <rdfs:label>Hospital Malpractice</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Hospital Malpractice: Negligent or wrongful actions or omissions committed by a hospital or its staff, resulting in harm or injury to a patient, and giving rise to a legal claim for damages.</skos:definition>
