    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Patent Law</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">חוק פטנטים</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel>Patent Law</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>Law is designed to encourage inventors to disclose their new technology to the world by offering the incentive of a limited-time monopoly on the technology.</skos:definition>
