    <rdfs:label>Estate Management Practice</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Estate Management Practice refers to the administration and oversight of a person's estate, including assets, liabilities, and financial affairs, both during their lifetime and after their death. It encompasses tasks such as estate planning, executing wills, managing trusts, and ensuring compliance with legal and tax obligations.</skos:definition>
