  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDnOT11bijp73ZvXW0E7Fbv">
    <skos:definition>A Forward Looking Statements Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the expectations or projections of future events or performance, and typically includes a disclaimer that actual results may differ.</skos:definition>
