  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCUjnmv57gJQKiEhT9naTGC">
    <skos:definition>An accord and satisfaction is a legal defense that arises when a debtor offers to pay a creditor a sum of money in exchange for the creditor releasing the debtor from further liability.</skos:definition>
