  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB9WPZAmqztZGzX1qXk6gXv">
    <skos:prefLabel>repliedTo</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>"Responded To" in legal contexts refers to the action of replying or reacting to a legal action, request, or communication. This includes formal legal responses such as answering a lawsuit, replying to a legal notice, or reacting to a court's order, and is crucial for the continuation and progression of legal processes.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <skos:altLabel>responded to</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>replied to</skos:altLabel>
