  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/0uV_p4o1TLmRUJJwidxHCQ">
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) manufacturing complete automobiles and light duty motor vehicles (i.e., body and chassis or unibody) or (2) manufacturing automobile and light duty motor vehicle chassis only. Vehicles made include passenger cars, light duty trucks, light duty vans, pick-up trucks, minivans, and sport utility vehicles.</skos:definition>
