    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R3SDQBy4KfjSgp3bgpb4Fx"/>
    <skos:definition>A legal right of a surviving spouse to claim a portion of their deceased spouse's estate, regardless of what is stated in the deceased spouse's will, in order to prevent disinheritance.</skos:definition>
