    <rdfs:label>195 Contract Product Liability (PACER NoS)</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>Action concerning damages caused by a defective product, not primarily involving personal injury or property damage, and based primarily on breach of contract, breach of warranty, misrepresentation, and/or violation of consumer protection laws.  Actions primarily alleging personal injury or property damage caused by a defective product should be classified under the appropriate nature of suit code under “TORTS.”</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
