    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">实际知识语言下的重大不利影响定义</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje de "Conocimiento Real"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הגדרת תוקף פגיעה חומרית - שפת "ידיעה בפועל"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>MAE</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Definición de Efecto Adverso Material - Lenguaje de "Conocimiento Real"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Material Adverse Effect Definition - "Actual Knowledge" Language</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">"वास्तविक ज्ञान" भाषा में सामग्री विपरीत प्रभाव की परिभाषा</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Definição de Efeito Adverso Material - Linguagem de "Conhecimento Real"</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">実際の知識言語における重大な不利な影響の定義</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>"Actual Knowledge" Language refers to a clause in a contract that outlines the specific circumstances under which a party can terminate the agreement if there is a significant negative impact on the financial condition or operations of the other party, and the party seeking to terminate has actual knowledge of such impact.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>A Material Adverse Effect (MAE) Definition with "Actual Knowledge" Language refers to a clause in a contract that outlines the specific circumstances under which a party can terminate the agreement if there is a significant negative impact on the financial condition or operations of the other party, and the party seeking to terminate has actual knowledge of such impact.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>"Actual Knowledge" Language</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>Material Adverse Effect Definition - "Actual Knowledge" Language</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCrshoNA9Tc4Xswrj0v8nqX"/>
  </rdf:Description>
