  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R76SBh2sN45UoKUS5e9vfzm">
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDp8cEr3KYyVDenm1P9ejdx"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCxfiZzG4dF6wN0pVL57OS"/>
    <skos:definition>Real Estate Broker's Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts: The legal responsibility of a real estate broker to a purchaser for intentionally withholding important information about a property that would have affected the purchaser's decision to buy, and the resulting legal claims that may be brought against the broker for such actions.</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">मूल्यवान तथ्यों के जानबूझकर अनभिवकरण के लिए रियल एस्टेट ब्रोकर की जिम्मेदारी खरीदार के प्रति</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Real Estate Broker's Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Responsabilité du courtier immobilier envers l'acheteur pour non-divulgation intentionnelle de faits matériels</skos:altLabel>
