    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">親子関係の妨害</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>The concept of "Interference with Parent-Child Relationship" refers to the intentional or negligent actions of a third party that disrupt or damage the relationship between a parent and their child, leading to emotional distress or harm.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>Tortious Interference with Parent-Child Relationship</skos:prefLabel>
