    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RXfDG78SSnJOuZPWGq21Ab"/>
    <rdfs:label>Failure to Exhaust Contractual Remedy</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>The Failure to Exhaust Contractual Remedy is a defense in civil litigation where the defendant argues that the plaintiff did not fulfill the contractual obligations before filing a lawsuit.</skos:definition>
