    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">M&amp;A救済措置</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>M&amp;A Remedies refer to the legal actions or provisions that are put in place to address issues that arise during or after a merger or acquisition, such as breaches of contract or failure to meet agreed-upon terms.</skos:definition>
