    <skos:definition>A surrogacy claim is a legal action related to the use of a surrogate mother to carry and give birth to a child, typically arising in the context of family law or matrimonial claims.</skos:definition>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
