    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">対価 - 商品</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Contrepartie - Biens</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Consideration - Goods</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Consideration of Goods is a legal term referring to tangible items or products that are provided as consideration, or something of value, in exchange for a promise or performance under a contract. One party's promise is exchanged for the goods provided by the other party.</skos:definition>
