    <rdfs:label>Other Chemical and Allied Products Merchant Wholesalers</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of chemicals and allied products (except agricultural and medicinal chemicals, paints and varnishes, fireworks, and plastics materials and basic forms and shapes).</skos:definition>
