  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBGCujfJShcjecj0Nz3yAy6">
    <skos:definition>A Billing and Payment Terms Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the terms and conditions for payment and billing between parties involved in the agreement.</skos:definition>
