    <rdfs:label>Education Liability</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Education Liability refers to the legal responsibility and accountability of educational institutions and their staff for any harm or injury caused to students or their families, including civil claims related to privacy of school records, corporal punishment, compulsory education, and prayer in public school.</skos:definition>
