    <skos:altLabel>Shareholder Voting Entitlement</skos:altLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Asset Voting Right</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>An Asset Voting Right is the entitlement of an individual or entity to participate in the decision-making process of a company or organization by casting a vote. It is a fundamental attribute of equity ownership, often associated with an entity's shares or ownership units.</skos:definition>
    <skos:prefLabel>Voting Share</skos:prefLabel>
