    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">雇主过失抵消</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">नियोक्ता दोष सेट-ऑफ</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Employer Fault Set-off</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Compensación por culpa del empleador</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">雇用者の過失相殺</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">התאמה של טעויות המעסיק</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Compensação de culpa do empregador</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Employer fault set-off diminishes the amount of damages a defendant is liable for based on the comparative fault of a plaintiff's employer and/or co-employees, as well as a certain set-off from the Workers' Compensation benefits paid to date.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Employer Fault Set-off</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N6ce31f8ef3104e5f9f4e83b8c3b7897a"/>
