    <skos:definition>The concept of Asset Sale refers to the transfer of ownership of assets for a regulatory purpose (e.g., selling bankrupt or financially distressed company's assets to another party in order to raise funds and pay off creditors; e.g., to increase public benefits).</skos:definition>
