  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCRdGhCbWvSVjIhz7sM0FzY">
    <skos:definition>These rights pertain to the ownership and control of oil reserves located beneath a specific parcel of land. The owner of these rights can extract the oil or lease, sell, or transfer these rights to another party.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Oil Rights</rdfs:label>
