    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">相互豁免条款</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Mutual Release Clause</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Mutual Release Clause is a provision in a contract that allows both parties to relinquish any claims against each other, typically in exchange for some form of consideration.</skos:definition>
