    <rdfs:label>Actions Required Under Transaction Agreement Language</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Actions Required Under Transaction Agreement Language refers to the specific obligations and duties that must be fulfilled by parties involved in a legal transaction as outlined in the agreement, and which are exempted from the Material Adverse Effect (MAE) definition.</skos:definition>
