    <skos:notation>folio:adjudicated</skos:notation>
    <skos:notation>folio:decided</skos:notation>
    <skos:definition>In the legal arena, "decided" refers to the process of reaching a conclusion or verdict in a legal matter or legal document. This term encompasses various outcomes such as acceptance, affirmation, denial, or dismissal, representing the authoritative resolution or determination made by a court or tribunal.</skos:definition>
