    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=238220"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in installing and servicing plumbing, heating, and air-conditioning equipment. Contractors in this industry may provide both parts and labor when performing work. The work performed may include new work, additions, alterations, maintenance, and repairs.</skos:definition>
