    <skos:definition>Research appellate issues, Draft response to motions/other filings, Arguing motions/other findings, Attend motion hearing, Travel to &amp; from motion hearing, Prepare notice of appeal, Designing appellate record, Extraordinary writs/appellate proceedings, Review responses to appellate petition, Prepare response to appellate petition, Prepare petition appendix</skos:definition>
