  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R739Eh1oGW1PGIJZbrAC8b3">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Consumer Price Index Adjustment Clause</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Cláusula de ajuste del índice de precios al consumidor</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף התאמת מדד מחירי הצרכן</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Klausel zur Anpassung des Verbraucherpreisindex</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>CPI Adjustment Clause</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Clause d'ajustement de l'indice des prix à la consommation</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">消費者物価指数調整条項</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Cláusula de ajuste del índice de precios al consumidor</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Cláusula de ajuste do índice de preços ao consumidor</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">उपभोक्ता मूल्य सूचकांक समायोजन डाक</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">消费者价格指数调整条款</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Consumer Price Index (CPI) Adjustment Clause is a provision in a contract that allows for adjustments to be made to the contract price based on changes in the CPI, which measures the average change in prices over time for goods and services commonly purchased by households.</skos:definition>
