    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">法院书记员或元帅的费用</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>The Fees of Court Clerk or Marshal refer to the charges imposed by the court clerk or marshal for their services rendered in a legal matter, which are included in the overall Court Costs.</skos:definition>
