    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Negligencia en la Causación de Angustia Emocional a un Observador</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">גרימת נזק רגשי למצפה באופן של זניחות</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Fahrlässige Zufügung von seelischem Leid an einem unbeteiligten Dritten</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Inflição negligente de sofrimento emocional a um espectador</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">对旁观者的过失造成情感伤害</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Negligencia en la Causación de Angustia Emocional a un Tercero</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Causerie négligente de détresse émotionnelle à un spectateur</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Bystander</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">傍観者に対する過失による感情的苦痛の負担</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">एक दर्शक पर लापरवाही से भावनात्मक दुख उत्पन्न करना</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Bystander refers to a legal claim made by a person who has suffered emotional harm as a result of witnessing an injury or harm caused to another person due to someone else's negligence.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress on a Bystander</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
