    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBV3MQlbGLIUVo5fSiBZ2V4"/>
    <skos:definition>A Grand Jury Proceeding is a legal process where a group of citizens is convened to determine whether there is enough evidence to bring criminal charges against a person or entity.</skos:definition>
