    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Inverse Condemnation refers to a civil or constitutional claim brought by a property owner against the government for the taking or damaging of their property without just compensation.</skos:definition>
