    <skos:definition>Wind Energy Objectives refer to the regulatory and policy goals aimed at promoting, managing, and optimizing the development and use of wind energy. These objectives encompass environmental, economic, and technological factors to ensure sustainable and efficient wind energy deployment.</skos:definition>
