    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">סעיף הסכמה להעברה</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Consent to Assignment Clause is a provision in a contract that requires one party to obtain the consent of the other party before assigning or transferring its rights or obligations under the contract to a third party.</skos:definition>
