    <rdfs:label>Criminal Court Proceeding</rdfs:label>
    <ns2:legacyIdentifier>http://code.sali.org/v1/LMSS/#Proc-D-CCR</ns2:legacyIdentifier>
    <skos:definition>A criminal lawsuit; all or some part of a cause heard and determined by a criminal court. Any legal step or action taken at the direction of, or by the authority of a court.</skos:definition>
