    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Legal Malpractice</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel>Attorney Malpractice Claim</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>Legal Malpractice is the failure of an attorney to provide competent and professional legal services to a client, resulting in harm or damages to the client.</skos:definition>
