    <skos:definition>A person authorized by a state to administer oaths, certify documents, attest to the authenticity of signatures, and perform official acts in commercial matters.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>A person, usually licensed, who attests to the identity of a person who signs a document.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Notary Public</rdfs:label>
