    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
    <skos:definition>A Mutual General Release Clause is a provision in a contract that releases both parties from any claims or liabilities arising from the contract.</skos:definition>
