    <rdfs:label>Bankruptcy Chapter 7 Claim</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Bankruptcy Chapter 7 Claim is a type of claim made by a creditor in a bankruptcy case under Chapter 7 of the Bankruptcy Code, seeking to recover a debt owed by the debtor.</skos:definition>
