    <rdfs:label>Phlebotomy Negligence</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Phlebotomy Negligence refers to a type of medical negligence claim that arises when a healthcare professional fails to perform a blood draw procedure with the appropriate standard of care, resulting in harm to the patient.</skos:definition>
