    <skos:altLabel>Zoning Code</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Zoning Regulation</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:prefLabel>Land Use Ordinance</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Zoning Ordinance is a set of legal regulations adopted by municipal or other local government bodies that specifies the types of land use permitted within certain geographic areas. The ordinance usually includes zoning maps and text detailing the land use regulations for different zones, such as residential, commercial, industrial, and other specialized categories.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Zoning Ordinance</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
