  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/p_bflgGcRjupWWuJgLA_TA">
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in building foundation and structure trades work (except poured concrete, structural steel, precast concrete, framing, masonry, glass and glazing, roofing, and siding). The work performed may include new work, additions, alterations, maintenance, and repairs.</skos:definition>
