    <rdfs:label>Support Activities for Air Transportation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing services to the air transportation industry. These services include airport operation, servicing, repairing (except factory conversion and overhaul of aircraft), maintaining and storing aircraft, and ferrying aircraft.</skos:definition>
