  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCsMg9PSHTWeBjdWc5KTPNf">
    <skos:definition>Appraisal Management refers to the process of overseeing and coordinating the evaluation of an individual's performance or value, within the context of managing people.</skos:definition>
