    <rdfs:label>Merger Clause</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDe0RKU39BlhcyACJW30ZLc"/>
    <skos:definition>A merger clause is a contractual clause that specifies that the written agreement represents the entire agreement between the parties and supersedes any prior or contemporaneous oral or written agreements or understandings.</skos:definition>
