    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">相互責任制限条項</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A mutual limitation of liability clause is a provision in a contract where both parties agree to limit their liability to a certain amount or exclude certain types of damages in case of breach or other legal claims.</skos:definition>
