  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8RpTOwiNs5o1omuvFrx5I7">
    <rdfs:label>tax_authority_ref</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>In some countries tax invoices must be routed, approved and in some cases even delivered to the customers by a platform controlled and/or imposed by the tax authority.  This platform normally returns an approval code/identifier to the invoice issuer for audit trail purposes.  Such code/identifier may need to be communicated to the customer as a reference depending on the jurisdiction. Use this field to specify the approval code/identifier if required in your country.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RHfeijrOTjaF7qpuoGIGkR"/>
  </rdf:Description>
