    <rdfs:label>Return to Parent</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Return to Parent refers to the process of reuniting a child who has been placed in foster care with their biological parent(s) after the necessary steps have been taken to ensure the safety and well-being of the child.</skos:definition>
