    <rdfs:label>06 Forfeiture / Penalty (PACER NoS)</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>The concept of "06 Forfeiture/Penalty (PACER NoS)" refers to a specific category within the PACER Nature of Suit (NoS) Codes that deals with the legal process of seizing property as a penalty for drug-related offenses under 21 U.S.C. § 881.</skos:definition>
