    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=238390"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in building finishing trade work (except drywall, plaster, and insulation work; painting and wall covering work; flooring work; tile and terrazzo work; and finish carpentry work). The work performed may include new work, additions, alterations, maintenance, and repairs.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
