    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">免责声明条款</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Warranty Disclaimer Clause is a statement in a contract that negates or limits the warranty provided by the seller, indicating that the buyer accepts the product or service "as is" and assumes all risks associated with its use.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Warranty Disclaimer Clause</rdfs:label>
