    <rdfs:label>Effective Beginning Date</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Valid Beginning Date refers to the authorized starting date for a particular status, benefit, or action, often specified in official documents such as visas, permits, or contracts. It signifies when an individual is permitted to begin a specific activity, residency, or employment, as determined by the relevant regulatory authority</skos:definition>
