    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of sporting goods and accessories; billiard and pool supplies; sporting firearms and ammunition; and/or marine pleasure craft, equipment, and supplies.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9m7fEEboCdA3CLA3ndg65V">
