    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">גילוי חובה</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Statutory Lien</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A statutory lien is a legal claim or encumbrance on property that arises by operation of law, typically created by a statute, and provides security for the payment of a debt or obligation.</skos:definition>
