    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Grouping class for the internal departments/functions responsible for a given contract type. Sits alongside folio:Agreements under Transactional Document so a contract, its clauses, its defined terms and its owning department are all reachable from the same root.</rdfs:comment>
