    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>Deposition Practice refers to the legal process of obtaining sworn testimony from a witness outside of court, typically conducted in a lawyer's office or other location, as part of the discovery process in a legal matter.</skos:definition>
