  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R7PEVL4EDe99UD7dVx58cFp">
    <owl:inverseOf>folio:isEngagedBy</owl:inverseOf>
    <owl:inverseOf>sali:isEngagedBy</owl:inverseOf>
    <skos:notation>folio:retained</skos:notation>
    <skos:notation>folio:hired</skos:notation>
    <skos:notation>folio:engaged</skos:notation>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <skos:definition>In a legal and contractual context, "engaged" refers to the act of formally hiring or retaining a professional, such as a lawyer, expert, or contractor, to perform specific services. This involves entering into a professional relationship, often governed by a contract or agreement, where the engaged party agrees to provide their expertise or services in exchange for compensation or other terms.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>E.g., Client sali:engaged Lawyer</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>E.g., Lawyer sali:engaged Expert</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>E.g., Lawyer folio:engaged Expert</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition>E.g., Client folio:engaged Lawyer</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel>engaged</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>retained</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>hired</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8CdMpOM0RmyrgCCvbpiLS0"/>
    <rdfs:label>engaged</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>sali:engaged</rdfs:label>
    <skos:prefLabel>retained</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8CdMpOM0RmyrgCCvbpiLS0"/>
  </rdf:Description>
