    <rdfs:label>Recovery of a Chattel / Replevin</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Recovery of a Chattel or Replevin refers to the legal action taken to recover personal property that has been wrongfully taken or detained by another party.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
