    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Negligencia en la vacunación</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Négligence en matière de vaccination</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">הזנחת חיסון</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Negligencia en la vacunación</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">टीका लापरवाही</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Vaccine Negligence</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">疫苗过失</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">ワクチン過失</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Negligência na vacinação</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Impfverschulden</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Failure to provide proper care or attention in administering vaccines, resulting in harm or injury to the patient, and the legal claims that arise from such negligence.</skos:definition>
