  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R9B8sRCK209t5Y8LlU4f62a">
    <skos:altLabel>Legal Products</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Legal Use Cases</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Legal Use Cases refers to a set of various categories of tasks within the legal industry, which can be completed by humans, machines, or both. Examples include legal research, contract management, intellectual property management, compliance management, and other organizational' use cases for legal work.</skos:definition>
