  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RLp6HAh5lnWtjCFthm7TMP">
    <skos:definition>The Execution Sale is a legal process of selling assets to satisfy a debt or judgment, typically ordered by a court, and falls under the broader category of Liquidation of Assets.</skos:definition>
