    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">表明と保証の分類</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>"Classifications of Representations and Warranties" refer to the categorization of assertions made by one party to another in a contractual agreement regarding the state of affairs, facts, or promises.</skos:definition>
