    <skos:definition>All actions to investigate and understand the facts of a matter that are not included under another trademark task code below. Covers initial meeting to discuss new matter, interview of client personnel and potential witnesses, review of documents to learn the facts of a potential case, work with an investigator, and all related communications and correspondence.</skos:definition>
