    <rdfs:label>Export Controls Practice</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Export Controls Practice involves the legal frameworks and regulations governing the export of goods, services, and technology from a country. This practice area includes compliance with export control laws, export licensing, restrictions on certain goods and technologies, and enforcement of export regulations.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
