    <skos:definition>Pigs are domesticated omnivorous animals belonging to the species Sus scrofa domesticus, commonly raised for their meat (pork), lard, and hides. Known for their intelligence and versatile diet, pigs are a crucial part of agricultural practices and are bred in various environments worldwide.</skos:definition>
