    <skos:definition>Firm innovation personnel are individuals within a law firm or legal organization who are responsible for driving innovation and implementing new technologies or processes. They focus on improving efficiency, enhancing service delivery, and creating new business models to keep the firm competitive in an evolving legal landscape.</skos:definition>
