    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>A Custodian Agreement Clause is a provision in a contract that outlines the responsibilities and obligations of a third-party custodian who holds and manages assets on behalf of the contracting parties.</skos:definition>
