    <skos:prefLabel>PA360 Validation Patent Application Preparation - Domestic</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>All actions associated with the preparation and filing of applications for validation of an issued regional patent in the ('domestic') home country of the applicant. Note that PCT National Phase Entry is a continuing application process included under PA350 or PA550.</skos:definition>
