    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">飞行员过失索赔</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Pilot Negligence Claim is a legal claim made against a pilot for their failure to exercise reasonable care in the operation of an aircraft, resulting in harm or damage to others.</skos:definition>
