  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RA082f4BAA89d11Acd60Ec03">
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie des services religieux, philanthropiques et civiques</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">धार्मिक, अनुदान और नागरिक सेवा उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Religious, Grantmaking and Civic Services Industry</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Religious, Grantmaking and Civic Services</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Indústria de serviços religiosos, filantrópicos e cívicos</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de servicios religiosos, de concesión de subvenciones y cívicos</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de servicios religiosos, de concesión de subvenciones y cívicos</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית שירותי דת, מתן מענקים ושירותים אזרחיים</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">宗教、寄付、市民サービス産業</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">宗教、慈善和公民服务行业</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Religiöse, gemeinnützige und zivile Dienstleistungsbranche</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>Industries in the Religious, Grantmaking, Civic, Professional, and Similar Organizations subsector group establishments that organize and promote religious activities; support various causes through grantmaking; advocate various social and political causes; and promote and defend the interests of their members.

The industry groups within the subsector are defined in terms of their activities, such as establishments that provide funding for specific causes or for a variety of charitable causes; establishments that advocate and actively promote causes and beliefs for the public good; and establishments that have an active membership structure to promote causes and represent the interests of their members.  Establishments in this subsector may publish newsletters, books, and periodicals for distribution to their members.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Religious, Grantmaking, Civic, Professional, and Similar Organizations</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=813"/>
    <ns2:legacyIdentifier>http://code.sali.org/v1/LMSS/#Ind-BCS-CIVS</ns2:legacyIdentifier>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:prefLabel>Religious, Grantmaking and Civic Services</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:identifier>BCS-CIVS</dc:identifier>
    <skos:hiddenLabel>CIVS</skos:hiddenLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBsVax4c8Bdvzok8MTZKGD8"/>
  </rdf:Description>
