    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>The legal concept of Dram Shop Liability refers to the responsibility of a business or individual who serves or provides alcohol to someone who then causes harm or injury to another person as a result of their intoxication.</skos:definition>
