  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://staram.in/ontology/epc/register">
    <owl:versionInfo>https://staram.in/ontology/epc/register/0.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <dcterms:title xml:lang="en">Legal Risk Register 200 - Risk Heads (ABox)</dcterms:title>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://staram.in/ontology/epc#SourceModule"/>
    <dcterms:source>260807_Nodes_Risk_Register_200_GCC_STC_Corrigendum_copy.xlsx</dcterms:source>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">200 epc:RiskHead individuals, one per row of the Legal_Risk_Register_200
sheet, each carrying its serial number, its single legal-review category, one or more
drafting-defect types, the phase(s) it bites in and its likely impact types.

PROVENANCE OF EACH ASSERTION TYPE:
  epc:serialNumber, skos:prefLabel, epc:hasLegalReviewCategory  -&gt; verbatim from the sheet
  epc:hasDraftingDefectType                                     -&gt; keyword heuristic (see epc:classificationMethod)
  epc:arisesInPhase, epc:hasConsequence                          -&gt; inherited from the category, heuristic
  epc:aggravates / epc:relatedRisk / epc:compensates             -&gt; hand-curated, ~70 edges

Heuristic assertions are review candidates, not conclusions. Query
?h epc:hasDraftingDefectType epcx:defect-unclassified to get the manual triage worklist.</dcterms:description>
    <dcterms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-08-12</dcterms:created>
  </rdf:Description>
