    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Militärische Diskriminierung</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>The concept of Military Discrimination refers to claims of unfair treatment or prejudice based on an individual's past or present military service or affiliation.</skos:definition>
