    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">Capias Ad Respondendum</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">केपियास एड रिस्पोन्डेंडम</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Capias Ad Respondendum</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A "Capias Ad Respondendum" is a legal concept within the categories of Judicial and Procedural Tort Claims, which refers to a writ or order issued by a court to arrest and bring a defendant before the court to answer to a civil action or lawsuit.</skos:definition>
