  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/WXW-twbGQ9istckX90bCkw">
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the commercial catching or taking of finfish (e.g., bluefish, salmon, trout, tuna) from their natural habitat.</skos:definition>
