    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Superior Offer Thresholds</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>"Superior Offer" Thresholds</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A "Superior Offer" Threshold is a specific amount of assets or stock that must be offered in order to meet the requirements of a "Superior Offer" in a legal matter.</skos:definition>
