  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/StKB20avSAGLkRjtTXnnaQ">
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing metal kitchen cookware (except by casting (e.g., cast iron skillets) or stamped without further fabrication), utensils, and/or nonprecious and precious plated metal cutlery and flatware.</skos:definition>
