    <skos:definition>Strategic Communications Practice involves providing legal advice and services related to the management and dissemination of information to the public, media, and stakeholders, particularly in situations requiring public relations and crisis management. This legal practice ensures that communications are legally compliant, strategically effective, and aligned with the client’s objectives.</skos:definition>
