    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>E116 Trial transcripts</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Trial transcripts (E116) are a type of expense (E100) incurred during legal proceedings, which involve a written or recorded record of the trial proceedings.</skos:definition>
