  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/F5XN-eVwSoy5mn9Wba7yrw">
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=331314"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Secondary Smelting and Alloying of Aluminum</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) recovering aluminum and aluminum alloys from scrap and/or dross (i.e., secondary smelting) and making billet or ingot (except by rolling) and/or (2) manufacturing alloys, powder, paste, or flake from purchased aluminum.</skos:definition>
