    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) manufacturing heavy duty truck chassis and assembling complete heavy duty trucks, buses, heavy duty motor homes, and other special purpose heavy duty motor vehicles for highway use or (2) manufacturing heavy duty truck chassis only.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/6hr6liRTSX6Wmxsn_wob_w"/>
