    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">उचित सर्वोत्तम प्रयास मानक</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Reasonable Best Efforts Standard</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">合理的最善尽義務基準</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Standard der angemessenen besten Bemühungen</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Estándar de Mejores Esfuerzos Razonables</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:label>Reasonable Best Efforts Standard</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>A Reasonable Best Efforts Standard is a legal concept that requires a party to make a good faith effort to achieve a specific goal or outcome, taking into account the circumstances and resources available to them.</skos:definition>
