    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">समाधि का अधिकार</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Direito de sepultamento</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>The Right of Sepulcher is a legal claim that grants a person the right to control the burial and funeral arrangements of a deceased loved one.</skos:definition>
