  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RKbNrS4w1Sje9SRlafdHba">
    <rdfs:label>Board Treasurer</rdfs:label>
    <skos:altLabel>Finance Chair</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Corporate Treasurer</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Treasurer</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Board Treasurer is a board officer responsible for overseeing the financial affairs of an organization, including budget planning, financial reporting, and ensuring sound financial governance. The Treasurer works closely with management to monitor financial performance and ensure compliance with financial policies and regulations.</skos:definition>
