    <rdfs:label>Asset Voting Attributes</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Asset Voting Attributes encompass the various rights and limitations associated with voting entitlements linked to ownership of financial assets. These attributes include voting rights, non-voting rights, restricted voting rights, and enhanced voting rights, each defining the degree of influence a shareholder has in an organization's decision-making process.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
