    <rdfs:label>Entertainment Law</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Entertainment Law encompasses the legal services and regulations that govern the entertainment industry, including film, television, music, theater, and digital media. It deals with matters such as intellectual property, contracts, labor relations, and litigation related to entertainment activities.</skos:definition>
