    <skos:altLabel>Thrift Institution</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Thrift Bank</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition>A Savings and Loan Association (S&amp;L) is a financial institution primarily focused on accepting savings deposits and making mortgage loans. S&amp;Ls play a significant role in providing home financing, particularly for residential properties, by offering favorable mortgage terms to depositors.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
