    <skos:prefLabel>B260 Board of Directors Matters</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition>Preparation of materials for and attendance at Board of Directors meetings; analysis and advice regarding corporate governance issues and review and preparation of corporate documents (e.g., Articles, Bylaws, employment agreements, compensation plans, etc.)</skos:definition>
