    <skos:prefLabel>TR760 Domain Names - ccTLDs Domain Name Filing - Country Code</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label>TR760 Domain Names - ccTLDs Domain Name Filing - Country Code</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>All actions associated with completing a domain name application (including renewal) that is to be filed as a country code top-level domain (ccTLD), e.g., .jp, .uk, .tv. The domain name applications should be filed through the current domain name provider unless otherwise instructed.</skos:definition>
