  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RigrpcSYFHatuFsvX3s8X0">
    <skos:definition>Firm Information Services Personnel, also known as Firm IT Personnel, are professionals responsible for managing and maintaining the information technology infrastructure within a law firm or legal organization. They ensure the availability, security, and efficient operation of computer systems, networks, and data resources to support the firm's legal and administrative functions.</skos:definition>
