  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RDqvWcvBcUV4cKSUqlFKc4k">
    <skos:definition>Industries in this group include establishments that provide a wide array of tangible goods, such as automobiles, computers, consumer goods, and industrial machinery and equipment, to customers in return for a periodic rental or lease payment. thee include those that are engaged in renting consumer goods and equipment and those that are engaged in leasing machinery and equipment often used for business operations.</skos:definition>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="he-il">תעשיית שירותי השכרה וליסינג</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de-de">Miet- und Leasingdienstleistungsbranche</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ja-jp">レンタルおよびリースサービス業界</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>Rental and Leasing Services</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-gb">Rental and Leasing Services Industry</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr-fr">Industrie des services de location et de leasing</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-es">Industria de servicios de alquiler y arrendamiento</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="zh-cn">租赁服务行业</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hi-in">किराए और लीज़िंग सेवा उद्योग</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es-mx">Industria de servicios de renta y arrendamiento</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt-br">Indústria de serviços de locação e leasing</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RjKL1UdfWL1FCPVhnbIFSF"/>
