    <skos:prefLabel>A120 Processing</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label>A120 Processing</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>For discovery and eDiscovery, services associated with the processing of documents, images, files, etc. in a document collection. Includes OCR, importing/ingestion/overlay, exporting, file conversion and/or extraction when billed as a service. Excludes scanning (A117).</skos:definition>
