  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RRZQDX3XRtxNOixKc8JZSG">
    <skos:definition>A Candidate is an individual who is seeking selection, nomination, or election for a specific position, office, or role. This person typically undergoes a formal process of evaluation, campaigning, or competition to be chosen for the desired position, whether in a political, professional, or organizational context.</skos:definition>
