    <skos:definition>Machine Learning (ML) is a branch of Artificial Intelligence (AI) that focuses on developing systems capable of learning from data to perform tasks without being explicitly programmed. Learning involves optimizing model parameters through computational techniques to enhance the model's performance for specific training tasks</skos:definition>
