  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R8rp4pVVEUdC5SuV0nqwbuj">
    <skos:definition>Action by current prisoner, or former prisoner or their families alleging a civil rights, Federal Tort Claims Act, or state law claim with respect to a condition of prison life, whether general circumstances or particular episodes. Examples: inadequate medical care or excessive force by prison guards. Includes non-habeas actions by alien detainees alleging unlawful prison conditions.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RnhXmv223OLuy6W4pzIHlD"/>
