  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/R91pWaQviYCOFMSnuzZosu">
    <skos:definition>"Percentage tax rate against charge, i.e. 7.2516% tax_rate_percent would be represented as ""0.072516"". 

The value in this field is always positive.  In some countries, tax could be a negative number (for example, Brazil has a negative withholding tax), in which case TAX.increase_decrease = Decrease. 

If a Tiered Tax, the value in this field should be null.  The tax rates associated with a Tiered Tax are defined in the TAX_TIER_DETAIL segment."</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBZL31YCqZA1E1vlIkzRRqw"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>tax_rate_percent</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
