    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Risks that appear during delivery and project closeout, covering handover of right of way, recovery of advance payments, acceptance on commissioning, punch lists, operation and maintenance manuals, training, spare parts, joint venture liability, and retention of records.</skos:definition>
