    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=423310"/>
    <rdfs:label>Lumber, Plywood, Millwork, and Wood Panel Merchant Wholesalers</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of lumber; plywood; reconstituted wood fiber products; wood fencing; doors and windows and their frames (all materials); wood roofing and siding; and/or other wood or metal millwork.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
