  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/6X_dYC8VT8-r8HzqZOwpgQ">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/fD3HEmIjTCWjYGdG9M1m2g"/>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=332112"/>
    <rdfs:label>Nonferrous Forging</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing nonferrous forgings from purchased nonferrous metals by hammering mill shapes. Establishments making nonferrous forgings and further manufacturing (e.g., machining, assembling) a specific manufactured product are classified in the industry of the finished product. Nonferrous forging establishments may perform surface finishing operations, such as cleaning and deburring, on the forgings they manufacture.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
