    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3329"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing fabricated metal products (except forgings and stampings, cutlery and handtools, architectural and structural metals, boilers, tanks, shipping containers, hardware, spring and wire products, machine shop products, turned products, screws, and nuts and bolts).</skos:definition>
