    <skos:definition>Covers developing, negotiating, and revising the budget for a matter that does not fit under other task codes below. Cost estimates which are included as part of other activities, such as reporting an Official Communication from a Trademark Office, should be included under the appropriate task codes below, unless otherwise instructed by the client.</skos:definition>
