    <skos:definition>This U.S. industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in drilling oil and gas wells for others on a contract or fee basis. This industry includes contractors that specialize in spudding in, drilling in, redrilling, and directional drilling.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label>Drilling Oil and Gas Wells</rdfs:label>
