    <rdfs:label>Cookie, Cracker, and Pasta Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=31182"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) manufacturing cookies and crackers; (2) preparing flour and dough mixes and dough from flour ground elsewhere; and (3) manufacturing dry pasta.  The establishments in this industry may package the dry pasta they manufacture with other ingredients.</skos:definition>
