    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=313210"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in weaving broadwoven fabrics and felts (except tire fabrics and rugs). Establishments in this industry may weave only, weave and finish, or weave, finish, and further fabricate fabric products.</skos:definition>
