  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/IJgqXPZlTrCBhCrfXJJEEw">
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) tanning, currying, and finishing hides and skins; (2) having others process hides and skins on a contract basis; and (3) dyeing or dressing furs.</skos:definition>
