    <skos:altLabel>Energy Policy Goals</skos:altLabel>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RCDwLiS22z6MzQaQHS08hvk"/>
    <skos:definition>Energy Law Regulatory Objectives are the legal and policy goals that guide the regulation, management, and development of energy resources and systems. These objectives aim to ensure energy security, sustainability, economic efficiency, and environmental protection.</skos:definition>
