    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>JL20 Support of advocates (UK J-CODE)</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>Work by lawyers other than advocates relating to the above matters and all attendances at court on trial days including conferences or meetings before or after court and travel and waiting.  Where there is a substantial gap between trial days, work should be allocated to whichever is the more appropriate of the Trial Preparation and Trial phases.</skos:definition>
