    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>A Document Management Add-On is a specialized tool or feature that enhances the functionality of a Document Management system. It is a software component that can be added to an existing Document Management system to provide additional capabilities or improve existing ones.</skos:definition>
