    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Lessors of Real Estate</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in acting as lessors of (1) residential buildings and dwellings; (2) nonresidential buildings (except miniwarehouses); (3) miniwarehouses and self-storage units; and (4) other real estate property. This industry group includes equity real estate investment trusts (REITs) primarily engaged in leasing buildings, dwellings, or other real estate property to others.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5311"/>
  </rdf:Description>
