  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://staram.in/ontology/epc#EPCContractRiskModule">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">EPC Contract Risk (module root)</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Root of the EPC contract-risk module: risk heads from the 200-row legal risk register, findings located in the NHIDCL CH-83 tunnel EPC agreement, the document and allocation model, and two SKOS risk taxonomies. Parked in the sandbox pending alignment to the FOLIO/STARAM classes proper.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">ORGANISATIONAL, NOT SEMANTIC. The rdfs:subClassOf linking this node to 'ZZZ - SANDBOX: UNDER CONSTRUCTION' follows the convention already used by that class's other children; it does not assert anything meaningful about EPC risks. Removing that single triple detaches the entire EPC subtree and graduates the module. Do not build inference on it.</skos:note>
  </rdf:Description>
