    <rdfs:label>Apparel Knitting Mills</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=315120"/>
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in knitting apparel or knitting fabric and then manufacturing apparel. Jobbers, performing entrepreneurial functions involved in knitting apparel and accessories, are included.</skos:definition>
