  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/Pvd1kuq_TeSAxBtboNJypA">
    <skos:definition>This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in towing light or heavy motor vehicles, both local and long-distance. These establishments may provide incidental services, such as storage and emergency road repair services.</skos:definition>
