    <rdfs:label>Evidentiary Objectives</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>Evidentiary Objectives refer to the goals or purposes of presenting and challenging evidence in a legal proceeding. These objectives include ensuring the relevance, reliability, and fairness of the evidence, as well as preventing undue prejudice or confusion.</skos:definition>
