    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>Matter Management refers to the process of organizing and overseeing legal cases and related tasks, such as document management and budgeting, within a legal operations framework.</skos:definition>
