  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB3ZvRS88m0CGkHvru8NJfc">
    <skos:definition>Big Data refers to large, complex datasets that require advanced computational tools and methodologies for processing and analysis. These datasets are often characterized by their volume, velocity, and variety, making traditional data processing methods inadequate ​</skos:definition>
