  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RBPehVKHmGilQbPA55VggB6">
    <rdfs:label>Guilty</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:definition>In a criminal context, "guilty" is a legal determination made by a court or jury when the defendant has been found responsible or culpable for the charges brought against them. It signifies that the defendant has been proven to have committed the alleged crime and may face penalties or sentencing as a result of the guilty verdict.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="Nf62950aa56354ef7b1e785fe0d1ebc31"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://folio.openlegalstandard.org/RB3ZDkOj3NY83VeYDOB98XR"/>
  </rdf:Description>
