  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://staram.in/ontology/staram-core-modules">
    <dcterms:modified>2026-09-17</dcterms:modified>
    <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">Adds a tenth branch, "Compliance" (cmp:ComplianceModule, namespace https://staram.in/ontology/compliance#), modelling statutory compliances per the Universal Legislation-to-Compliance Extraction Master Prompt and the 29 Compliance Repository headings. Existing entities reused by the module keep their original parents and are additionally placed under the module; no existing triple was removed or changed.</dcterms:description>
  </rdf:Description>
